Hunspell English dictionaries (SCOWL)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

dictionaries/en and dictionaries/en-GB (used by the experimental
`prose.engine = "spellbook" | "hybrid"`) come from wooorm/dictionaries:

  Source:    https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries
  Files:     dictionaries/en/index.{aff,dic}, dictionaries/en-GB/index.{aff,dic}

Their licenses (SCOWL and derived word lists) are in dictionaries/en/license
and dictionaries/en-GB/license.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Harper curated dictionary
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

dictionaries/harper/words.tsv.zlib is generated from the curated English
dictionary of harper-core (word list, dialects and word classes) by
scripts/update-harper-words.sh; the harper-core version is in its header line.
Builds with the `harper` cargo feature also link harper-core itself.

  Source:    https://github.com/Automattic/harper
  Files:     harper-core/dictionary.dict, harper-core/annotations.json
             (as expanded by harper_core::spell::MutableDictionary::curated)

